{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUSHCRAFT SURVIVAL\u00a0</strong>is <i>truly procedural</i>, and infinite. An endless boreal forest set in Canada's northern wilderness is generated each time a new play session starts in <strong>Survival Mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permanent skill tree progression allows you to build on your skills and knowledge, gaining access to new shelter types, tools, and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/leanto.gif?t=1747582648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See how many days you can survive in spite of snow storms, injuries and unexpected setbacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is in<strong>\u00a0early development</strong>\u00a0by a Canadian, solo indie developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/hatchet.gif?t=1747582648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft resources, build shelters, and keep your tools sharp. Survive against the elements by keeping your temperature, energy and hydration in check.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/fire.gif?t=1747582648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd28 Construct high quality bushcraft structures: lean-to, lavvu, snow shelter, more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf32 Collect natural resources such as bark, moss, branches, sticks and logs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Manage your tools to make sure they are well maintained and sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26f0\ufe0f Explore the vast wilderness to find caches of new tools and resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b06\ufe0f\u00a0Spend skill points on a permanent upgrade tree for new shelter and tool types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc1f Sustain yourself with fishing and trapping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DISCORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join the discord</strong>, and feel free to ask any questions about the game or its development under BUSHCRAFT-SURVIVAL in #chat!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529110?t=1747582648","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529110?t=1747582648","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/3ef2c1fbba88a174b4ac7982c3b887f70266d3a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747582648","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/3ef2c1fbba88a174b4ac7982c3b887f70266d3a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747582648","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUSHCRAFT SURVIVAL\u00a0</strong>is <i>truly procedural</i>, and infinite. An endless boreal forest set in Canada's northern wilderness is generated each time a new play session starts in <strong>Survival Mode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permanent skill tree progression allows you to build on your skills and knowledge, gaining access to new shelter types, tools, and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/leanto.gif?t=1747582648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See how many days you can survive in spite of snow storms, injuries and unexpected setbacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is in<strong>\u00a0early development</strong>\u00a0by a Canadian, solo indie developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/hatchet.gif?t=1747582648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft resources, build shelters, and keep your tools sharp. Survive against the elements by keeping your temperature, energy and hydration in check.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/fire.gif?t=1747582648\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd28 Construct high quality bushcraft structures: lean-to, lavvu, snow shelter, more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf32 Collect natural resources such as bark, moss, branches, sticks and logs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f Manage your tools to make sure they are well maintained and sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26f0\ufe0f Explore the vast wilderness to find caches of new tools and resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b06\ufe0f\u00a0Spend skill points on a permanent upgrade tree for new shelter and tool types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc1f Sustain yourself with fishing and trapping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DISCORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join the discord</strong>, and feel free to ask any questions about the game or its development under BUSHCRAFT-SURVIVAL in #chat!</p>","developers":["Michael Jared Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/46c34ce8217ef4544228e00514db1159382f7bed/header.jpg?t=1747582648","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125712,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail